    "message": "Rendering React applications server-side with an embedded JS runtime inside .NET is no longer supported, and prevents utilizing many modern React technologies such as server components. If you are using an older version of Cloud Framework, we recommend moving your React stack to the Redpoint fork of Twofold: https://github.com/RedpointGames/twofold/ and communicating with your .NET backend over gRPC.",
